  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
  {
    "insert": "Room for improvement:\nIf I understood that right, the first paragraph is State of the art. You can try line it out with separate subsection to increase readability and introduce structure."
  },
  {
    "insert": "\n",
    "attributes": {
      "list": "bullet"
    }
  },
